commits.message:
refactor(host): update imports after core/ extraction

Point commands and services at crate::core::{error,log_util,fs,paths}
so the tree matches the completed module move.

fix(library): only scope papers under papers/ tree

Clicking notes/.agents/plans no longer filters the library empty;
show the full catalog instead. Fix #160

fix(translate): drop freeBaseUrl from settings and free-MT probes

Align frontend settings/defaults/probe with commercial BYOK config only;
update unit tests for commercial registry coverage.

feat(figures): simplify analysis sidebar cards and sections

Neutral cards show only thumbnail, caption, and top-right page label;
sections are collapsible; rename the rail header to Analysis / 解析 and drop the count badge.

feat(pdf-layout): stop parsing formula number text

Keep formula+formula_number geometric merge and text-overlap filters;
drop equation-id string extraction so sidebar uses i18n fallback labels.

docs: update backend docs for scholar_api::identifiers paths

- Replace references to import/parse.rs and import/resolver.rs
- Point to scholar_api::identifiers::{parsers,resolver,fallback}

feat(agent): show language label on PlainCodeBlock

Add a slim top bar with a lowercase mono language tag on the left;
hover copy/download stay on the right.

style(ui): retune default palette to Apple system gray

Cool low-chroma neutrals separate sidebar, canvas, and elevated surfaces;
Library gets translucent sticky header, hairline rows, and cleaner canvas.

i18n(onboarding): soften titlebar tour copy

Remove the panel-toggling emphasis from the final feature tour step;
keep it focused on starting to explore the vault and tutorial notes.

chore(deps): bump vitest to 4.1.11

Fixes GHSA-82fw-gwwq-j7x9 / CVE-2026-84373 (path traversal in
@vitest/mocker redirect mock).
